{{!-- Deleting the item from its own sheet. Included at the foot of every item
sheet, so the act sits at the end of the item's own data rather than in the
header, where it would be one slip away from the name field.

Worn gear has no button at all: the actor's `system.equipment` would keep
pointing at an id that no longer resolves, and the paper doll is where a piece
comes off. The hint says so rather than showing a control that refuses. --}}
{{#if canDelete}}
  <div class='item-delete-row'>
    <a class='item-self-delete' title='{{localize "TNO.Item.Delete"}}' tabindex='0'>
      <i class='fas fa-trash'></i>
      <span>{{localize 'TNO.Item.Delete'}}</span>
    </a>
  </div>
{{else if isWorn}}
  <p class='hint item-delete-hint'>{{localize 'TNO.Item.DeleteWornHint'}}</p>
{{/if}}
